This kit has no upstream. Its engine and editor are Kition's own (KitionAI/kition, Apache-2.0):
the packages board-kit, board-editor, and app-ui, built from the Kition commit the package
records (kit-ui.json), with kition-sdk's kdm, kit-engine, and kit-ui.

Third-party material

The engine bundles Loro (loro-crdt, MIT), whose WebAssembly ships beside it. The editor bundles
the npm packages listed in web/package.json under their own licenses (MIT, ISC, Apache-2.0).
